      "readme_sha": "1686690d7aef76d6c42d164d02002c739b35582b",
      "readme_excerpt": "NVIDIA Cosmos™ is a platform purpose-built for physical AI, featuring state-of-the-art generative world foundation models (WFMs), robust guardrails, and an accelerated data processing and curation pipeline. Designed specifically for real-world systems, Cosmos enables developers to rapidly advance physical AI applications such as autonomous vehicles (AVs), robots, and video analytics AI agents. Cosmos World Foundation Models come in three model types which can all be customized in post-training: cosmos-predict, cosmos-transfer, and cosmos-reason. * [February 23, 2026] Released Predict2.5 /Robot/Action-Cond Distillation guide, and Predict2.5 /Robot/Policy models (RoboCasa, Libero), inference and post-training recipe in cosmos-cookbook. * [December 19, 2025] Released Cosmos-Predict2.5-2B Diffusers support",
